2. Tokenizer
------------

Files:   tokenizer/tokenizer.json, tokenizer/tokenizer_config.json and
         tokenizer/special_tokens_map.json, regenerated from the pinned base.
Origin:  mmBERT's model card lists its tokenizer as the Gemma 2 tokenizer
         (Google). It reaches this artifact through mmBERT-base and
         laya-multilingual unchanged in vocabulary.
Terms:   Gemma models are distributed by Google under the Gemma Terms of Use
         (https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms). Whether those terms cover the
         tokenizer vocabulary as redistributed by mmBERT under MIT has not
         been confirmed; it must be confirmed before a release.
